# Replace XXXXXX with the inviteCode returned by request 3
@code = XXXXXX

### 1. Create Diego (id 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Diego" }

### 2. Create Anna (id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Anna" }

### 3. Diego creates a room → copy the inviteCode into @code above
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "creatorId": 1 }

### 4. Anna joins the room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2 }

### 5. Next film for Diego → film 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/next-film?userId=1

### 6. Diego likes film 1 → match: false
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "filmId": 1, "liked": true }

### 7. Anna likes film 1 → match: true 🎉
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "filmId": 1, "liked": true }

### 8. Diego votes film 1 again → 409 "Film already voted"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "filmId": 1, "liked": false }

### 9. Next film for Diego → film 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/next-film?userId=1

### 10. Next film for Anna → film 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/next-film?userId=2

### 11. Matches in the room → film 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{code}}/matches


### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Diego",
  "password": "lime-password"
}
